---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  active="About"
  description="Christopher Hynes’s background in statistics, economics, and computer science, and interests in lifting, history, languages, travel, and small software projects."
>
  <section class="page-intro shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">About / Christopher Hynes</p>
    <h1>
      About
      <br />
      <em>Christopher Hynes.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="page-deck">
      Outside work, I lift weights, play guitar, backpack, and study languages.
    </p>
  </section>
  <div class="about-grid shell">
    <section class="prose" aria-labelledby="interests-title">
      <h2 id="interests-title">Outside work</h2>
      <p>I read a lot of history and tend to get sidetracked on Wikipedia.</p>
      <p>
        I also build lots of random things with AI coding tools, such as{' '}
        <a href="/projects/foodai/">a pantry and recipe app</a>, gym and caffeine trackers, and a
        program that generated variations of a friend’s name. Some are useful. Most aren’t.
      </p>
      <h3>Travel & languages</h3>
      <p>
        I spent a year studying in Madrid and have visited 32 countries. I speak advanced Spanish,
        intermediate German, and basic French.
      </p>
      <figure class="travel-figure">
        <img
          src="/assets/been.jpeg"
          alt="A personal map showing countries I have visited."
          width="3600"
          height="1950"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <figcaption>Countries I’ve visited.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>
    <section class="prose" aria-labelledby="background-title">
      <h2 id="background-title">My background</h2>
      <p>
        I’m completing an M.S. in Computer Science at Georgia Tech, after earning a B.S. in
        Statistics and Economics from the University of South Carolina Honors College. My graduate
        work spans machine learning, empirical evaluation, and software development.
      </p>
      <p>
        At South Carolina, I worked as an undergraduate research assistant with economic,
        demographic, and public-health data. The projects covered STEM-worker agglomeration, spatial
        segregation, and racial disparities in birth outcomes.
      </p>
      <p>
        At GreyNoise, I analyzed customer retention and lead conversion and worked on finance
        workflows.
      </p>
      <div class="about-links">
        <a class="text-link" href="/experience/">
          Experience & education <Arrow />
        </a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/assets/resume.pdf">
          My résumé <Arrow diagonal />
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px 28px;
  }
  .about-links .text-link {
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
